# Android / Gradle 构建产物
#   注意：build/android/ 下的**脚手架**（build.gradle、gradlew、MainActivity.java、overlay.json、gradle-wrapper.jar）必须入库，
#   否则 APK 无法从仓库复现；只忽略 Gradle 生成的产物。
apps/client/build/android/**/build/
apps/client/build/android/.gradle/
apps/client/build/android/local.properties
apps/client/build/android/.idea/
*.apk
*.aab
*.hprof

